<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>BeadsMood - 비즈 악세사리</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-black font-sans">

  <!-- 헤더 -->
  <header class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">BeadsMood</h1>
    <nav class="space-x-4 text-sm">
      <a href="#bracelets" class="hover:underline">팔찌</a>
      <a href="#necklaces" class="hover:underline">목걸이</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="hover:underline">문의</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- 메인 배너 -->
  <section class="text-center py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">세상에 하나뿐인 비즈 악세사리</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">BeadsMood와 함께 감성을 담다 💫</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 팔찌 목록 -->
  <section id="bracelets" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6 border-b border-black inline-block pb-1">💫 팔찌</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- 상품 카드 1 -->
      <div class="border rounded-xl p-4 shadow hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="비즈 팔찌 1" class="rounded mb-2">
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg">하트 비즈 팔찌</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">핑크/화이트 조합으로 러블리한 무드</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-bold">₩8,000</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 상품 카드 2 -->
      <div class="border rounded-xl p-4 shadow hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="비즈 팔찌 2" class="rounded mb-2">
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg">이니셜 팔찌</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">이름 넣는 우정팔찌 맞춤제작</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-bold">₩10,000</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 목걸이 목록 -->
  <section id="necklaces" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6 border-b border-black inline-block pb-1">💫 목걸이</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

      <!-- 상품 카드 1 -->
      <div class="border rounded-xl p-4 shadow hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="비즈 목걸이 1" class="rounded mb-2">
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg">컬러팝 비즈 목걸이</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Y2K 감성의 컬러풀 목걸이</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-bold">₩12,000</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 상품 카드 2 -->
      <div class="border rounded-xl p-4 shadow hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="비즈 목걸이 2" class="rounded mb-2">
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg">하트 진주 목걸이</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">러블리하면서도 우아한 분위기</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-bold">₩13,500</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 문의하기 -->
  <section id="contact" class="bg-gray-50 py-10 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">문의하기</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">카카오톡 @BeadsMood 또는 인스타 DM으로 문의해주세요 💬</p>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-black text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full hover:opacity-80">인스타그램 가기</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 푸터 -->
  <footer class="text-center text-sm text-gray-400 py-6">
    © 2025 BeadsMood. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
